        "key_context": "Victor is spiraling into alcoholism ('Liq') but remains functional. He observes the poverty around him to justify his actions. He applies 'varnish' to his life to hide the 'rot' from Carey, trying to ensure Carey has the tools to survive even as Victor burns out.",
